{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Flow of Self-Healing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395760/extras/62e04c64b293c53e938b4b8016a3df29.poster.avif?t=1765506251\" width=700 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395760/extras/62e04c64b293c53e938b4b8016a3df29.webm?t=1765506251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395760/extras/62e04c64b293c53e938b4b8016a3df29.mp4?t=1765506251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slip into a calm and soothing flow state with a variety of healing music albums and stress-relief white-noise tracks. Paired with the gentle movements of your fish and the shimmering water in your aquascaped tanks, you\u2019ll enter a peaceful, focused moment of quiet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay concentrated, ease into your flow, achieve your goals, and earn Fish Coins along the way!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deep Focus</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395760/extras/13c0ee3f1ec43c8efaef5c339c99489a.poster.avif?t=1765506251\" width=700 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395760/extras/13c0ee3f1ec43c8efaef5c339c99489a.webm?t=1765506251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395760/extras/13c0ee3f1ec43c8efaef5c339c99489a.mp4?t=1765506251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add custom focus tasks, start a Pomodoro timer, and keep track of your to-dos. Make full use of the time-management tools we\u2019ve prepared!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With consistent practice, you\u2019ll gradually build a healthy focus habit, whether that means sharpening your concentration or getting delightfully absorbed in fish-keeping. We hope this becomes a space where you meet a better version of yourself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Colorful Aquarium</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395760/extras/38c6f92d6e71e0c94692d904bad72db5.poster.avif?t=1765506251\" width=700 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395760/extras/38c6f92d6e71e0c94692d904bad72db5.webm?t=1765506251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>&quot;Fish Only!&quot;</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy, feed, breed, aquascape, and clean! Experience the joy of aquarium keeping in your own cyber fish tank.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself to collect <strong>over 170 unique fish species!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a fish expert with our dedicated encyclopedia entries and fun educational facts for every species.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sprinkle fish food or use your scraper! Maintain your underwater paradise with helpful in-game tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate with ornaments of various styles and craft a personalized tank that your fish can truly call home.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fishkeeper Community</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395760/extras/41c01fe100e15bc362fb89758c796ef3.poster.avif?t=1765506251\" width=1024 height=319 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395760/extras/41c01fe100e15bc362fb89758c796ef3.webm?t=1765506251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy intimate moments with your fish\u2014or dive into a lively community of fellow fish lovers!<br>Show off your own aquarium with pride, send bouquets to other players\u2019 creations, and make new friends through the world of fish.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>More Wonderful Memories</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395760/extras/7566b1fc24998c62a36b77b406a03ac7.poster.avif?t=1765506251\" width=1024 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395760/extras/7566b1fc24998c62a36b77b406a03ac7.webm?t=1765506251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395760/extras/7566b1fc24998c62a36b77b406a03ac7.mp4?t=1765506251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try unlocking hidden conditions to receive special Dark Choco gifts, or discover warm blessings sent from players across regions and languages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Record your journey and cherish every small moment along the way.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Aquatic Time With Me","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3395760/15411a8f763ad002d25e6e61c2ebca937a4478e9.jpg"},{"name":"Dark Mystery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3395760/f04e82d87261179ee1a5fae4e4c445e65abe6b55.jpg"},{"name":"Volume Expansion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3395760/ae14fa1e7beb8e6175ebaf4fdd11de889ca0d4cc.j